# Cursor workflow

Product memory is `CLAUDE.md`. Do not copy it into rules or `AGENTS.md`.

- This checkout is shared. Owen pushes to `origin/main`. `git fetch origin` before starting feature work.
- Never `git add -A` or `git add .`. Stage explicit paths only. `.env` and `ledger/*.csv` are secrets.
- Untracked files you did not create are someone else's WIP. Leave them.
- New work goes on a branch, not on `main`.
- After pushing a feature branch, open a PR against `main` in the same turn. Don't wait to be asked. Skip only if a PR for that branch already exists. Don't merge unless asked.
- GitHub CLI (`gh`) is a system install on PATH. If `gh auth status` is not logged in, run `gh auth login --hostname github.com --git-protocol https --web --skip-ssh-key` and give Jacob the one-time code; do not fall back to a compare URL until that login has actually failed. GitHub MCP is read-only for PRs on this machine — do not use it to create pull requests.
- Node is a system install on PATH. (Both it and `gh` were portable no-admin copies under `%LOCALAPPDATA%` until 2026-09; those folders are gone, and so is the `.vscode` PATH prepend that pointed at one.)
